      "message": "(I don\u0027t have CR+1 bits.)\n\nFWIW, I think it was already the case that, even before https://pdfium-review.googlesource.com/c/pdfium/+/136210, every file that included JBig2_SymbolDict.h also included JBig2_Image.h. Otherwise this would never have compiled.\n\nSee https://godbolt.org/z/6o3fT9rWq\n\nIn both C++20 and C++23, this inline method requires `CJBig2_Image to be available. It\u0027s just that C++20 tolerated you defining `CJBig2_Image` *after* `CJBig2_SymbolDict::AddImage` while C++23 needs it to be in the right order.\n\nSo I expect this change will not change compile times, because the header was getting included anyway.\n\nThat said, based on https://godbolt.org/z/ec9csbKq9, it does look like this version is also valid, so LGTM.",
